# Repo-root build context is shared by multiple Dockerfiles
# (logos/logos-orchestrator/Dockerfile and iris/Dockerfile). Whitelist exactly what
# those Dockerfiles COPY so the context stays small and untracked local files
# (benchmarks, calibration data, .git, …) never get uploaded to the builder.
*
!shared
!logos/db
!logos/logos-orchestrator/pyproject.toml
!logos/logos-orchestrator/src
!logos/logos-orchestrator/tests
# iris/Dockerfile build context (COPY iris/... and memiris)
!iris/pyproject.toml
!iris/poetry.lock
!iris/src/iris
!iris/log_conf.yml
!iris/models
!memiris
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
